The '''Overbridge''', also known as the '''war room''',<ref name="Dawn" /> was the [[Bridge (starship)|bridge]] and main command center of the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|DS-1 Death Star Mobile Battle Station]], the [[Galactic Empire]]'s first [[moon]]-sized [[battle station]]. It housed duty posts for [[Death Star Trooper]]s,<ref name="DS Incredibuilds" /> such as [["Tulip" style Imperial work station]]s, and a large pentagonal [[viewscreen]] that displayed the status of [[Mk I Superlaser|the]] [[Death Star]] [[superlaser]],<ref name="Episode IV">{{Film|IV}}</ref> as well as designated posts for [[Grand Moff]] [[Wilhuff Tarkin]] amongst other [[Imperial officer]]s' and a [[HoloNet]] booth for communicating with [[Darth Sidious|the]] [[Galactic Emperor|Emperor]].<ref name="Tarkin">[[Tarkin (novel)|''Tarkin'']]</ref> A [[Death Star conference room|conference room]] was located beside it.<ref name="SWHC1">[[Star Wars Helmet Collection 1|''Star Wars Helmet Collection'' 1]]</ref>

